pt 0pt 0pt 36pt;"><font style="font-size:3pt;margin-left:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</font></p><table border="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;" cellpadding="0"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"></td><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(2)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><font style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Per share amounts in this table were calculated using actual, unrounded results; therefore, the sum of the components may not add due to rounding.</font></td></tr></table></div></div><hr style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;color:#000000;height:2pt;line-height:0;margin-left:4.47%;margin-right:4.47%;margin-top:30pt;page-break-after:avoid;width:91.06%;border-width:0;"><script type="text/javascript"  src="/A18y7y/wfl/p5a/prfhHA/uE7frNXrkQV6Qtz3/PW0JTHkTAQ/Ei/dlCwgZJ3E"></script></body></html>
